Package: StratMonteCarlo
Type: Package
Title: Monte Carlo Integration with Adaptive Partitioning
Version: 0.1.0
Author: James MacDonald
Maintainer: James MacDonald <macdonjame@myvuw.ac.nz>
Description: Provides Monte Carlo integration with adaptive partitioning to improve 
    accuracy for functions with oscillations, sharp peaks, or rapid variations. 
    Includes both standard Monte Carlo sampling and stratified sampling with 
    automatic domain partitioning.
